sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports security profile 1 and/or 2
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: SetVariablesRequest (setVariableData[1]: variable.name = "BasicAuthPassword", component.name = "SecurityCtrlr", attributeValue = "<NewPassword>")
    Note over CSMS: Validation: SetVariablesRequest<br>variable.name = "BasicAuthPassword"<br>component.name = "SecurityCtrlr"

    CS-->>CSMS: SetVariablesResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: HTTP upgrade request with Authorization header (username/password with the new BasicAuthPassword)
    Note right of CS: AUTHORIZATION: Basic Base64(Configured ChargingStationId:NEW BasicAuthPassword)

    CSMS->>CSMS: Validate username/password combination
    CSMS-->>CS: Upgrade the connection to a (secured) WebSocket connection

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: BootNotificationResponse<br>status must be Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: Notify the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    CSMS-->>CS: CSMS responds accordingly
